{"ID":"20240504161432-m5xrf4i","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504161432-m5xrf4i","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504161432-m5xrf4i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620102424-fux4iae\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240616172926-6smf2pd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:900,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620102424-fux4iae\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"080白兔藿（白葛）","type":"doc","updated":"20240807194603"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240807194600-9s0jsyr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240807194600-9s0jsyr","updated":"20240807194603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（缺）"}]},{"ID":"20240607131300-piaj07i","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607131300-piaj07i"}},{"ID":"20240616172819-rrww9cj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616172819-rrww9cj","updated":"20240616172823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白兔藿《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240616172819-1bl6dyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616172819-1bl6dyy","updated":"20240616172819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦平。"}]},{"ID":"20240616172819-8mcq0ej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616172819-8mcq0ej","updated":"20240616172819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主蛇虺，蜂虿，猘狗，菜肉蛊毒注。一名白葛。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240616172819-9vt1x2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616172819-9vt1x2d","updated":"20240616172819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：白兔藿，一名白葛谷（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240616172819-6zrvdkk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616172819-6zrvdkk","updated":"20240616172819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生交州。"}]},{"ID":"20240616172819-ugq70xt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616172819-ugq70xt","updated":"20240616172819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案陶宏景云：都不闻有识之者，都富似葛耳；《唐本》注云：此草荆襄山谷大有，俗谓之白葛。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131300-vovz9jm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607131300-vovz9jm"}},{"ID":"20240616172810-dujb6vo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616172810-dujb6vo","updated":"20240616172814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白兔藿《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240616172810-o9638ha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616172810-o9638ha","updated":"20240616172810"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦平。主蛇虺蜂虿狗。菜肉蛊毒注。一名白葛。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240616172810-nj283yl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616172810-nj283yl","updated":"20240616172810"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"捣药山端。思防凌触。衙聚潮蜂。溪盘雾蝮。螈狗攫腓。蛊蚕入腹。饮汁涂创。喜莫予毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616172810-r5uc4x8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616172810-r5uc4x8","updated":"20240616172810"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"古歌诗。采取神药山端。白兔捣虾蟆丸。易。君子以思患而豫防之。云笈七签。遇物凌触。"}]},{"ID":"20240616172810-3q9yo2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616172810-3q9yo2j","updated":"20240616172810"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"埤雅。蜂有两衙应潮。淮南子。蛇游雾而动。左传。国人逐螈狗。春秋后语。徐之狗。攫公孙子之腓。吴志传。虫入其腹。李曰。煮汁饮。捣末敷诸毒。阿含经。涂创不贪其味。"}]},{"ID":"20240616172810-m703mes","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616172810-m703mes","updated":"20240616172810"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左传。而后喜可知也。曰莫予毒也已。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131300-yhd1wax","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607131300-yhd1wax"}},{"ID":"20240607131301-xvtsy9m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20240607131301-xvtsy9m","updated":"20240607131357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白兔藿《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240607131301-fwj2upm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131301-fwj2upm","updated":"20240607131301"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名白葛，蔓生，叶圆浓若 ，茎俱有白毛。味苦，平，无毒。主蛇虺、蜂虿、 犬、菜肉、蛊毒、鬼疰、风疰，诸大毒不可入口者，煮汁饮之，即解。又去皮，可末着痛上，立消。五月采苗叶，日干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607131302-nshtkho","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607131302-nshtkho"}},{"ID":"20240607131402-xd6u6wf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20240607131402-xd6u6wf","updated":"20240607131410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白兔藿《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240607131402-fxhuwfy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131402-fxhuwfy","updated":"20240607131402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无毒．主治风疰，诸大毒不可入口者，皆消除之．又去血，可末着痛上，立消．者，煮饮之即解．生交州．"}]},{"ID":"20240607131402-jdudx62","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607131402-jdudx62","updated":"20240607131402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶白兔藿，味苦，平．主蛇虺、蜂虿、 狗、菜肉蛊毒，鬼注．一名白葛．生山谷．"}]},{"ID":"20240607131402-vy6jieb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607131402-vy6jieb"}},{"ID":"20240616172745-y7fwyks","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616172745-y7fwyks","updated":"20240616172756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白兔藿《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616172745-5c3rva6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616172745-5c3rva6","updated":"20240616172745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，平，无毒。主蛇虺、蜂虿、 狗、菜肉、蛊毒，鬼疰，风疰，诸大毒不可入口者，皆着痛上，立消。毒入腹者，煮饮之即解。一名白葛。生交州山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240616172745-kmf63tu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616172745-kmf63tu","updated":"20240616172745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"人不复用，殊不可解，都不闻有识之者，想当似葛尔，须别广访交州人，未得委悉。"}]},{"ID":"20240616172745-tgu64tv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616172745-tgu64tv","updated":"20240616172745"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕此草，荆、襄间山谷大有，苗似萝摩，叶圆浓，茎俱有白毛，与众草异。蔓生，山南俗谓之白葛，用疗毒有效。而交广又有白花藤，生叶似女贞，茎叶俱无毛，花白，根似野葛，云大疗毒。而交州用根，不用苗，则非藿也。用叶苗者，真矣。二物所疗，并如经说，各自一物，下条载白花藤也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616172746-8my65h4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616172746-8my65h4"}},{"ID":"20240616172925-w9u23fp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616172925-w9u23fp","updated":"20240616172930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白兔藿《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616172925-lbuvswn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616172925-lbuvswn","updated":"20240616172925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，平，无毒。主蛇虺、蜂虿、 狗、菜肉、蛊毒，鬼疰，风疰，诸大毒不可入口者，皆消除之。又去血，可末着痛上，立消。毒入腹者，煮饮之即解。一名白葛。生交州山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240616172925-mbkuwif","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616172925-mbkuwif","updated":"20240616172925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶此药疗毒，莫之与敌，而人不复用，殊不可解，都不闻有识之者，想当似葛尔，须别广访，交州人未得委悉。唐本注云∶此草荆、襄间山谷大有，苗似萝摩，叶圆浓，茎俱有白毛，与众草异。蔓生，山南俗谓之白葛。用疗毒有效。而交、广又有白花藤，生叶似女贞，茎叶俱无毛，花白，根似野葛，云大疗毒，而交州用根不用苗，则非藿也。用叶苗者，真矣。二物疗治，并如《经》说，各自一物，下条载白花藤也。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本图经云∶蔓生，叶圆若 ，今襄州北、汝州南岗上有。五月、六月采苗，日干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616172925-zcv2kp8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616172925-zcv2kp8","updated":"20240616172925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"海药云∶主风邪热极，宜煮白兔藿饮之。干则捣末，敷诸毒妙。"}]},{"ID":"20240616172925-zmg6d78","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616172925-zmg6d78"}},{"ID":"20240616172926-6smf2pd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616172926-6smf2pd"}}]}